WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.060
- At age 15, I attempted
to make my own sword.

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.193
It's taken me several years
to become a master craftsman.

00:00:08.123 --> 00:00:09.864
(hammer thumping)

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.470
My name is Kenneth Spivey.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.514
I'm an artist and prop maker.

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:20.181
(buzzing)
(soft music)

00:00:23.116 --> 00:00:26.340
I had to learn
blacksmithing for the blade.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.370
Leatherwork for the sheath and the handle.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.620
Engraving.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.690
Lapidary for cutting the stone.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:33.933
Setting skills.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.163
The movie industry moved
over to the Atlanta region.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.963
And that led to my first real gig.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:47.163
I've worked on many movies, many shows.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.450
I know now that there
might be some kid out there

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.490
who's watching these
films, seeing these pieces,

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:57.720
and saying, how can I make that?

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.698
It's pretty cool.

